---
import '../styles/global.css' 
import Header from '../components/header.astro'
---


<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>EDUPSCH</title>


        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Ballet:opsz@16..72&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	</head>


<body class="m-0 pt-15 md:pt-0">
    <Header/>

    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-4 p-5 grid-template-rows-[repeat(76,auto)]
    md:grid-cols-11 md:grid-template-rows-[repeat(76,auto)]">

        <!-- specs -->
        <div class="hidden
        md:inline md:row-start-10 md:col-start-9 md:row-span-3 md:col-span-2 md:place-self-center">
            <img class="md:p-12 grayscale" src="/billeder/cphdox/specs_cphdox.jpg">
        </div>


        <!-- baggrunds gif -->
        <div class=" row-start-1 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-13 place-self-center
        md:hidden">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/pretty.gif" class="saturate-100 w-300">
        </div>
        <div class="hidden
        md:inline md:row-start-1 md:col-start-1 md:row-span-7 md:col-span-11">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/pretty_horisontal.gif" class="md:saturate-100 md:w-full">
        </div>
        
        <!-- tribal divider -->
		<div class="z-5 row-start-15 col-start-2 col-span-2 row-span-2 place-self-center
        md:row-start-8 md:col-start-5 md:row-span-2 md:col-span-3 md:place-self-center">
			<img class="md:pt-10" src="http://dl.glitter-graphics.net/pub/621/621641xy2arhaa2t.gif" width=300 height=111>
		</div>
        
        <div class="z-20 row-start-5 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-4
        md:row-start-3 md:col-start-5 md:row-span-2 md:col-span-3">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-center text-blue-600 text-[40px] p-10">
                I also do live visuals & this is from CPH:DOX
            </p>
        </div>

        
        <div class="z-10 row-start-17 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-4
        md:row-start-10 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-2 md:col-span-4 md:pt-30">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px] hyphens-auto">
                I've been doing live visuals since my stay at <span class="hidden md:inline"><br></span> Engelsholm Højskole in the spring of 2021.
                <br> 
                <br> this is my creative playground.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="z-10 row-start-20 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-2
        md:hidden">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-blue-600 text-[40px] pt-20">
                let's partiiiiiiii!
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden
        md:inline md:row-start-13 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-2 md:col-span-4">
            <p style="font-family: 'Ballet', cursive;" 
            class=" text-blue-600 text-[100px]">
                Let's partiiiiiiii!
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="z-8 row-start-19 col-start-4 row-span-3 place-self-center 
        md:row-start-15 md:col-start-4 md:row-span-3 md:col-span-1">
            <img class="p-4 md:p-0" src="/billeder/cphdox/hahamig2.gif" class="saturate-200 w-50">
        </div>

        <!-- emojiesss -->
        <div class="row-start-22 col-start-1 row-span-1 col-span-1
        md:row-start-12 md:col-start-6 md:place-self-center">
            <p class="text-[30px]">
                🪩
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="hidden
        md:inline md:row-start-14 md:col-start-2 md:place-self-end">
            <p class="text-[30px]">
                🧃
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-23 col-start-1 row-span-1 col-span-1 place-self-center
        md:row-start-15 md:col-start-8 md:row-span-2 md:place-self-center">
            <p class="text-[30px]">
                🎠
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="z-10 row-start-22 col-start-2 col-span-3 row-span-2
        md:row-start-15 md:col-start-5 md:row-span-1 md:col-span-3">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px] hyphens-auto
            md:pl-10">
                I got hired to do visuals at two parties hosted by CPH:DOX.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-24 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-3
        md:row-start-16 md:col-start-5 md:row-span-2 md:col-span-5">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px] hyphens-auto
            md:pt-10 md:pl-10" lang="en">
                I had total creative freedom, so I decided to match the theme of the visuals, 
                to the theme & aesthetics of the 
                documentary <span class="font-bold italic">"Jaripeo"</span>, that had 
                just premiered.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="z-0 row-start-27 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-5 saturate-200
        md:row-start-18 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-5 md:col-span-7 md:pt-20">
            <video autoplay muted loop controls class="border-2 border-pink-600 md:border-2">
                <source src="/billeder/cphdox/charlottenborg1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        </div>

        <div class="z-10 row-start-32 col-start-1 col-span-2 row-span-3 
         md:row-start-23 md:col-start-4">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px] pt-10 hyphens-auto
            md:hyphens-none md:pt-30">
                the visuals were personal, sensual, confrontational, colorful, shiny, engaging, funny & loud.
                <span class="hidden md:inline"><br><br> just like the documentary.</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <!-- MLP -->
         <div class="z-10 row-start-33 col-start-3 col-span-2 row-span-3
         md:row-start-24 md:col-start-7 md:row-span-4 md:col-span-3">
            <img class="saturate-200" src="http://dl4.glitter-graphics.net/pub/1176/1176934fnbulcyxto.gif" width=645 height=452>
         </div>


        <div class="z-8 row-start-36 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-3 place-self-center 
        md:row-start-29 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-5 md:col-span-7">
            <img class="p-2 md:p-0 md:w-220 md:pt-10" src="/billeder/cphdox/girlgallop.gif">
        </div>
        
        <div class="z-8 row-start-44 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-3 place-self-center 
        md:row-start-34 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-5 md:col-span-7">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/horsies.gif" class="saturate-150 p-2 md:w-220 md:pt-10">
        </div>

        <div class="z-8 row-start-50 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-3 place-self-center 
        md:row-start-39 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-5 md:col-span-7">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/oejne.gif" class="saturate-150 p-2 md:w-220 md:pt-10">
        </div>

        <div class="z-8 row-start-55 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-3 place-self-center 
        md:row-start-44 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-5 md:col-span-7">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/BWmig.gif" class="saturate-150 p-2 md:w-220 md:pt-10">
        </div>

        <div class="hidden 
        md:inline md:row-start-49 md:col-start-3 md:row-span-5 md:col-span-7">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/mangeoejne.gif" class="saturate-150 p-2 md:w-220 md:pt-10">
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-60 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-3
        md:row-start-54 md:col-start-4 md:row-span-2 md:col-span-4">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px] pt-10 hyphens-auto
            md:pt-30" lang="en">
                to make it even MORE fun, I aimed my iphone camera at the crowd, the dj 
                & myself broadcasting them on the big screen, creating fierce moments of 
                self expression.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hidden
        md:inline md:row-start-55 md:col-start-8 md:place-self-center">
            <p class="text-[30px]">
                💘
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="z-0 row-start-63 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-5 saturate-200 pt-10
        md:row-start-56 md:col-start-4 md:col-span-5 md:row-span-3 md:pt-8 md:p-0">
            <video autoplay muted loop controls class="border-2 border-pink-600">
                <source src="/billeder/cphdox/liveeee2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-70 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-4
        md:row-start-59 md:col-start-4 md:row-span-4 md:col-span-3">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-blue-600 text-[40px] pt-20 hyphens-auto
            md:pt-30" lang="en">
                i love my job, 
                <br> it's so colorful 
                <br> & i'm a great 
                <br> visual curator
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="row-start-75 col-start-2 col-span-2 row-span-2 place-self-center
        md:row-start-61 md:col-start-7">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/lol.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>





    </div>



</body>

</html>